    <detaileddescription>
<para>NOTE: Unlike <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_use" kindref="compound">llvm::Use</ref>, this is not an integral part of the use-def chains. It is also not uniqued and is currently passed by value, so you can have more than one <ref refid="classllvm_1_1sandboxir_1_1_use" kindref="compound">sandboxir::Use</ref> objects for the same use-def edge. </para>
